  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Infrastructure Assistance Program Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sustainable Infrastructure Assistance Program Phase 2 (SIAP-2) is a partnership with the Asian Development Bank. SIAP2 provides technical assistance to support the effective identification, preparation, implementation, and financing of infrastructure projects in Indonesia. The partnership is focused on infrastructure projects in the energy, transport, urban services, and water resource sectors, to be financed or cofinanced by the ADB.</narrative>
  </description>
